---
source: crates/yard-cli/tests/db.rs
expression: stdout(&out)
---
postgres-17  running
  Host      127.0.0.1
  Port      5433
  User      me
  Password  (none)
  Socket    /Users/me/.yard/run  (the directory; a client takes it as the host)
  URL       postgresql://me@127.0.0.1:5433

  TablePlus: open the URL, or paste it
  DBeaver, DataGrip, Postico: a new PostgreSQL connection with the fields above
  yard postgres open [database] opens the URL in your client

For agents and scripts: yard postgres connect --json
